.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p
    Review value-based PEPM pricing, choose how often the organization pays, and track open and paid invoices.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p
    OG bills from value delivered. Anyone can see how value is defined on the
    = succeed "." do
      = link_to "OG Value page", organization_value_path(organization)

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Only teammates with Manage Billing can change cadence or open invoices.
    %li Shows the next three billing dates. OG Value Analysis (Lookback / This period / Next period) appears for locked periods and for the current incomplete period only. Lookback is always the ~90-day PEPM window; driver activity in period columns is scaled to that length for fair comparison.
    %li Until the calculation date (one week before due), amounts are “likely”; on that day we lock PEPM and open an invoice.
    %li Charges round down to the nearest $0.50 — below $0.50 per teammate, you pay nothing. Invoice totals are capped at value delivered.
    %li If value already existed before billing, a one-time control can create historical open invoices for prior-setpoint comparisons.
    %li Open each invoice to review details and use Pay (stub until checkout ships). Closed invoices include paid and waived.
